                    "reason": "Exact date of subletting creation (1970) and specific room boundaries are not explicitly detailed in the text, though the existence of the subletting is confirmed. The specific room ID is not provided, only described as part of the premises",
                    "evidence": [
                      {
                        "segment_id": "p0006.s005",
                        "quote": "Apart from the circumstances mentioned above it has been further found established that the respondent landlord had given a notice to the appellant to quit determining the tenancy on 21st May, 1975. In reply to the aforesaid notice the tenant appellant had not disclosed that by a deed of assignment dated 21st June 1974 in favour of Sujoy Kumar Das Gupta sub-letting had been made. Thus this fact was not disclosed even in the reply to the notice as late as 6.6.1975. "
                      },
                      {
                        "segment_id": "p0006.s006",
                        "quote": "This fact regarding sub-letting to Sujoy Kumar Das Gupta came to the notice of the landlord respondent for the first time on 15th September, 1975 when Sujoy Kumar Das Gupta, the Sub lessee himself sent a notice through his Solicitor intimating to the respondent landlords that partnership between Shri Gupta and appellant had been dissolved. In the said notice it had been stated that the appellant Pulin Behari Pal due to old age and physical infirmities had become unable to discharge his duties in the partnership business and as such had transferred, assigned all his interest, goodwill of the business and his right, title and interest to the said Sujoy Das Gupta absolutely and forever. "
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "DECLARED_DEPENDENCY"
                  }
                ]
              },
